<view class="container"><view class="demo">本地演练版 · 不产生真实付款或安装权益</view>
<view class="title">订单与安装 · 是两件事</view><view wx:if="{{order}}" class="card"><view class="heading">{{order.paymentText}}</view><view class="row">交付状态：{{order.deliveryText}}</view><view class="row">订单编号：{{order.id}}</view><view class="row">安装版本：{{order.product.version}}</view><view class="small">演练付款成功不代表电脑已经安装成功。</view><button class="primary" wx:if="{{order.paymentStatus === 'paid'}}" bindtap="claim">演练继续安装</button><button wx:if="{{order.paymentStatus === 'paid'}}" bindtap="refund">演练退款并撤销领取权益</button><button wx:if="{{order.paymentStatus === 'pending'}}" bindtap="checkout">返回确认订单</button></view><view wx:if="{{claimMessage}}" class="success">{{claimMessage}}</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><button bindtap="refresh">重新查询订单</button><button bindtap="orders">查看我的订单</button><button bindtap="help">安装问题自查</button>
</view>
